- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#18 (mes)
- "I told him.. What good is a ring for an old lady?"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#19 (mes)
- "[Jeum-sun]"
+ ""
#: npc/re/instances/FacewormsNest.txt#20 (mes)
